WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.333
Welcome to the Man of Recaps.

00:00:01.333 --> 00:00:04.600
This is Fear The Walking Dead, full series recap.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.800
It's the first of The Walking Dead spinoff shows,

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.733
whose premise was to show
the zombie apocalypse as it happened.

00:00:09.733 --> 00:00:12.200
You know, the fun part, that Rick Grimes slept through.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.033
Our story begins in Los Angeles, where we follow the Clark family,

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:18.533
led by Madison Clark, a no-nonsense mom
who is a high school guidance counselor.

00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:20.933
Her boyfriend is the English teacher, Travis Manawa,

00:00:20.933 --> 00:00:23.800
And these two have been happily
dating for a bit after Madison's first husband's death.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.233
She has two kids from her first marriage, her daughter, Alicia, likes art and boys.

00:00:27.233 --> 00:00:29.833
But her son, Nick, is a troubled kid who has become a drug addict.

00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:32.700
And in fact, he's
one of the first people to see a zombie.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.233
Reports come in of this new virus,

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:36.300
so in the show they call the zombies “infected.”

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.200
Most people don't understand
that these infected are the walking dead.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.633
But the Clark family,
luckily, is quick on the uptake.

00:00:41.633 --> 00:00:45.600
Travis went out to find his ex-wife, and son Chris,
who was at the riots in downtown.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.433
As things escalate, they seek shelter at a local barber shop run by Daniel Salazar.

00:00:49.433 --> 00:00:51.766
But as things escalate even more, they all flee downtown

00:00:51.766 --> 00:00:53.366
for the relative safety of the Clark house.

00:00:53.366 --> 00:00:56.766
Turns out the Clark house is very safe
because pretty soon the military rolls up.

00:00:56.766 --> 00:00:58.366
Their neighborhood is strategically located,

00:00:58.366 --> 00:01:00.566
so the military's making it their home base safe zone.

00:01:00.566 --> 00:01:02.066
And so the Clarks got really lucky,

00:01:02.066 --> 00:01:04.666
the first week of the zombie apocalypse, they're basically chillin’.

00:01:04.666 --> 00:01:06.133
The Salazar's are still chillin’ with them,

00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:07.700
Travis is like, “Yeah, they're my cousins?”

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:11.000
But Daniel's wife broke her ankle, and anyone who's remotely injured they're taking away,

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.033
including Nick,
who's got a fever from withdrawal.

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:14.500
The military is like “Don't worry, they're fine.”

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:17.433
But Daniel Salazar lived through
the civil war in El Salvador,

00:01:17.433 --> 00:01:18.733
he knows something's up.

00:01:18.733 --> 00:01:21.933
So as his daughter Ophelia befriends one of the soldiers, Daniel kidnaps him.

00:01:21.933 --> 00:01:26.033
And turns out he has a very dark past, he was the professional torture guy.

00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:27.866
Yeah, it seems like he's
escalating a bit too quickly,

00:01:27.866 --> 00:01:30.000
but he does learn that
they're losing Los Angeles.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.633
And on their way out to try to stop the spread,

00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:33.233
they're going to kill
this whole neighborhood.

00:01:33.233 --> 00:01:35.833
Over at the holding cells, Nick meets
Victor Strand.

00:01:35.833 --> 00:01:38.500
An apparently rich guy who's a smooth talking con man,

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:40.233
that befriends Nick as a potential ally.

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:42.166
So as the base gets overrun, Nick and Strand escape,

00:01:42.166 --> 00:01:44.600
while the rest of the crew comes in to save them,
and they all fight their way out.

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:46.566
But oh no, Travis’ ex-wife got bit!

00:01:46.566 --> 00:01:50.033
And it's the classic zombie apocalypse thing, he’s got to put her down.

00:01:50.033 --> 00:01:54.666
Now Los Angeles is lost, but the Victor Strand is a house
 in the hills, complete with a yacht.

00:01:54.666 --> 00:01:58.866
So in season two, as the military bombs Los Angeles as a last ditch effort to stop the spread,

00:01:58.866 --> 00:02:02.533
the Clark family and friends take to the sea on a luxury yacht the Abagail.

00:02:02.533 --> 00:02:04.966
Uh, yeah, once again, they got real lucky.

00:02:04.966 --> 00:02:07.800
A lot of people at sea are not so lucky, Alicia's like, “We got to help them.”

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:09.700
But Victor Strand's like, “Sorry, boat’s full.”

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:11.866
One day on the radio,
Alicia meets a hot boy

00:02:11.866 --> 00:02:14.400
and tells them where the boat is because he and his friends need their help.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.733
But of course it was a trap.

00:02:15.733 --> 00:02:17.400
They take Alicia back to their base
at the harbor

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.933
and are going to kill
the rest of her friends.

00:02:18.933 --> 00:02:22.000
But this crew's messing with the wrong people,
and immediately they break free.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.100
They negotiate the hostage exchange, unfortunately, 
they killed their hostage.

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:26.566
But the good thing about the zombie apocalypse, 

00:02:26.566 --> 00:02:28.633
dead people are still able to walk around.

00:02:28.633 --> 00:02:30.833
So our crew disembarks
as they make it to their destination,

00:02:30.833 --> 00:02:33.100
Victor Strand's villa in Mexico.

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:35.100
Yeah these Clarks got real lucky.

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:36.600
Now it's actually Victor's boyfriend's house,

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.800
and unfortunately, he just got bit, oh no!

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.933
It's his mom-slash-housekeeper who's in charge here now,

00:02:40.933 --> 00:02:42.433
and she's doing the thing that Herschel did,

00:02:42.433 --> 00:02:44.100
where she doesn't believe the zombies are really dead.

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:45.866
So when Victor shoots his boyfriend to stop him from turning,

00:02:45.866 --> 00:02:48.500
 she's real mad, going to kick Victor and the Clark family out.

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.500
But Madison Clark will do whatever
it takes to protect her family.

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:54.500
So she brings this woman down to the cellar and locks her up with the zombies.

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.333
But there's another problem when Travis' son Chris

00:02:56.333 --> 00:02:58.133
is standing over their bed with a knife.

00:02:58.133 --> 00:03:01.066
Yeah ever since his mother's death, he's become kind of deranged.

00:03:01.066 --> 00:03:02.700
And he's not the only one who's going crazy,

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:05.333
Daniel Salazar starts hallucinating his wife, who didn't make it.

00:03:05.333 --> 00:03:08.000
And for some reason, he decides to burn the villa down.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.433
So as the Clarks are heading out, Nick is like “Yo Mom,”

00:03:10.433 --> 00:03:12.000
“this has kind of been a lot of family time,”

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.766
“I'm at that age where I need to strike out on my own.”

00:03:14.766 --> 00:03:16.733
Aw, kids. They grow up so fast.

00:03:16.733 --> 00:03:19.366
Now early on Nick discovered if you cover yourself in the zombie blood

00:03:19.366 --> 00:03:21.300
so you smell like the dead, they won’t attack you.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.900
So now Nick walks around with the dead for protection,

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:26.000
yeah he's ahead of the curve on the Whisperers.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:28.933
Pretty soon he's found by Luciana, who takes Nick back to her Colonia,

00:03:28.933 --> 00:03:30.866
which is a nice happy place, Nick loves it here,

00:03:30.866 --> 00:03:33.333
and Nick and Luciana get it on!

00:03:33.333 --> 00:03:35.233
The rest of the crew comes to a fancy beach resort,

00:03:35.233 --> 00:03:37.833
where they broker a peace between the hotel guests and the hotel staff.

00:03:37.833 --> 00:03:40.333
Working together they make a plan to lure all the zombies out,

00:03:40.333 --> 00:03:43.433
and now it's a really nice place to ride out the zombie apocalypse.

00:03:43.433 --> 00:03:45.400
The Clarks have lucked out once again.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:48.866
But anyone in the area who needs supplies has to shop at the Cartel supermarket

00:03:48.866 --> 00:03:50.600
Madison overhears Her son Nick was here,

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:54.200
so she turns on the lights at the hotel, hoping he'll find his way home.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:56.300
Unfortunately, that attracts everyone in the area,

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:58.500
not including Nick, but including Travis.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:01.233
He and Chris went off on their own, on a father son apocalypse road trip.

00:04:01.233 --> 00:04:03.900
But soon they're joined by these douchebag frat boy spring breakers.

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:07.733
And when they stop at a farm, Chris shoots this farmer, no mercy!

00:04:07.733 --> 00:04:09.066
Oh, he's lost.

00:04:09.066 --> 00:04:10.600
Travis is trying to get through to his son,

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:13.033
But Chris is like, “Yo Dad, this has been a lot of family time,”

00:04:13.033 --> 00:04:15.000
“I think I need to go off on my own.”

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.966
Aw, kids. They grow up so fast.

00:04:16.966 --> 00:04:18.533
Pretty soon those frat boys come to the hotel too,

00:04:18.533 --> 00:04:21.366
where apparently they were in a big crash, and no! Chris died.

00:04:21.366 --> 00:04:23.333
But Travis realizes their story didn't add up,

00:04:23.333 --> 00:04:25.466
and he figures out that Chris survived the crash,

00:04:25.466 --> 00:04:28.000
but because he broke his leg, he was dead weight and they killed him!

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:32.566
So Travis goes berserk! And murders these guys with his bare hands.

00:04:32.566 --> 00:04:34.300
After this, the Clarks are kicked out of the hotel,

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:36.933
They go to Nick’s Colonia, which is overrun after a fight with the Cartel.

00:04:36.933 --> 00:04:39.100
Nick is leading his new Mexican family across the border

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:40.733
for hopefully a better life in America.

00:04:40.733 --> 00:04:42.433
But turns out the border is still guarded,

00:04:42.433 --> 00:04:43.833
Nick and Luciana are captured.

00:04:43.833 --> 00:04:46.333
So in season three, Madison follows Nick across the border,

00:04:46.333 --> 00:04:49.133
where she and Alicia are given the warm
welcome by this nice guy, Troy.

00:04:49.133 --> 00:04:51.166
But he's not so nice to the brown people in the group,

00:04:51.166 --> 00:04:54.033
where he's killing them, running experiments to see how long it takes them
to turn.

00:04:54.033 --> 00:04:57.433
Soon Madison figures him out and attacks him, oh! Spoon to the eye!

00:04:57.433 --> 00:05:00.000
Madison Clark, hard core!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.200
But just then another guy shows up like, “Whoa, sorry, That's my crazy brother.”

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.200
“Just let him go and we'll sort this all out.”

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.433
Turns out they're not the military, they're from a ranch nearby,

00:05:07.433 --> 00:05:09.766
And most of them are good people, “Sorry about Troy.”

00:05:09.766 --> 00:05:12.533
When zombies show up, they and up separated, Travis takes the helicopter.

00:05:12.533 --> 00:05:14.366
But the helicopter is not the safer option,

00:05:14.366 --> 00:05:16.700
someone shoots at it and Travis gets hit!

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:19.133
Aw, Travis! Just when you were getting cool.

00:05:19.133 --> 00:05:22.533
So the Clarks arrive at The Ranch, run by old man Jeremiah Otto.

00:05:22.533 --> 00:05:23.900
And this ranch is a great place to be,

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:27.200
It's a doomsday prepper community,
so it's incredibly well-prepared.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:29.100
Madison's like, “Yo, we're going to make this our home.”

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:31.600
“And if we don't like how they're running things, we'll just take it over.”

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:35.166
The good brother Jake is on their side, because he and Alicia immediately start dating.

00:05:35.166 --> 00:05:37.900
But Troy is a different story, he's definitely a bit of a psychopath.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.266
But in the zombie apocalypse, maybe a psychopath

00:05:40.266 --> 00:05:42.266
is exactly who you want on your side.

00:05:42.266 --> 00:05:44.866
Madison, the guidance counselor, knows
how to get through to this kid,

00:05:44.866 --> 00:05:46.433
starts becoming his like, mother figure.

00:05:46.433 --> 00:05:49.000
Nick of course wants to kill him, but Nick's a little bit crazy too,

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.866
and these two become best friends.

00:05:50.866 --> 00:05:54.266
Luciana is still here, but the people at the ranch really don't like Mexicans,

00:05:54.266 --> 00:05:56.066
so she decides to leave the show... for now.

00:05:56.066 --> 00:05:59.766
So as the ranch is searching for who shot at the helicopter, they come across one of their scouts, 

00:05:59.766 --> 00:06:02.033
and it's an incredibly memorable, disturbing scene,

00:06:02.033 --> 00:06:05.000
as he's still talking because the raven is picking at his brain!

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:08.833
And so we meet Qaletaqa, leader of the Native American Reservation,

00:06:08.833 --> 00:06:11.633
who wants the ranchers to leave because they're on our land.

00:06:11.633 --> 00:06:14.033
So in this war, because the Clarks are living at the ranch,

00:06:14.033 --> 00:06:16.300
they de-facto find themselves on the ranch’s side.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.133
But it becomes apparent Qaletaqa is the good guy,

00:06:18.133 --> 00:06:21.966
Before the zombie apocalypse, Jeremiah Otto murdered his father and got away with it.

00:06:21.966 --> 00:06:23.900
So Alicia, the optimist, tries to make peace,

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:26.500
and who does she find here but Ophelia Salazar!

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:29.166
She ended up crossing the border too, and was taken in by Qaletaqa.

00:06:29.166 --> 00:06:31.800
They negotiate the hostage deal where Ophelia goes to the ranch.

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:34.933
But the next morning all the guards get sick, oh she poisoned their coffee!

00:06:34.933 --> 00:06:37.433
With her kids in danger, Madison Clark is ready to end this war,

00:06:37.433 --> 00:06:39.600
and so she kills Jeremiah Otto!

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:41.366
Well, technically, it was Nick who pulled the trigger.

00:06:41.366 --> 00:06:44.233
And so there's peace for the new generation, all going to live at the ranch together.

00:06:44.233 --> 00:06:46.300
But even if they can all get along, it's not going to work,

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.400
because the ranch is almost out of water.

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:50.966
So they go to El Bazar, at the old football stadium,

00:06:50.966 --> 00:06:52.866
a lawless place where you can buy anything.

00:06:52.866 --> 00:06:56.133
Nick and Troy have a wild night, getting high on zombie brainstems.

00:06:56.133 --> 00:07:00.000
And who do they find here but Victor 
Strand, who's got a lead on a ton of water.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.133
All the water in this region comes from the dam,

00:07:02.133 --> 00:07:04.200
And Victor Strand is friends with the owner.

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:06.500
Well, not friends so much as someone he once conned.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:09.466
But turns out one of this guy's guards is Daniel Salazar.

00:07:09.466 --> 00:07:12.700
Yes he survived the villa fire and ended up befriending the water resistance.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:16.000
When this guy finds out Daniel was a death squad killer, he recruits them for security.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.133
But Daniel kills this guy and sides with the Water Queen,

00:07:18.133 --> 00:07:20.066
who's distributing water more fairly to people.

00:07:20.066 --> 00:07:22.900
So as Madison is negotiating a deal for the water, there's trouble back at the ranch,

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:24.966
because a zombie horde is coming right to it!

00:07:24.966 --> 00:07:27.766
Yes Troy did not accept the peace between the ranch and the reservation,

00:07:27.766 --> 00:07:30.166
so he's luring this horde here to destroy the whole thing.

00:07:30.166 --> 00:07:32.266
It's a big old zombie fight! But the ranch is destroyed,

00:07:32.266 --> 00:07:33.933
and Alicia is the sole survivor.

00:07:33.933 --> 00:07:35.733
But unfortunately, Ophelia was bit,

00:07:35.733 --> 00:07:37.900
And as Daniel is about to be reunited with his daughter,

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:40.000
he's minutes late to say goodbye.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.533
Meanwhile, Madison finally learns it was
Troy who led the zombies to the ranch.

00:07:43.533 --> 00:07:44.866
And it's a tragic situation as Troy

00:07:44.866 --> 00:07:47.166
kind of wants to be a good boy
for his new mother figure.

00:07:47.166 --> 00:07:50.333
Madison realizes he's too much of a loose cannon and oh! She kills him.

00:07:50.333 --> 00:07:51.766
But things are looking up for Madison Clark, 

00:07:51.766 --> 00:07:53.500
who's got a new safe home here at the dam.

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.966
Unfortunately, the motorcycle gang that runs the Bazar, The Proctors,

00:07:55.966 --> 00:07:57.600
is coming to take it right now.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:00.900
And they have an inside man, because Victor Strand cut a deal with them.

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:02.333
And as he and Daniel fight it out,

00:08:02.333 --> 00:08:04.233
Oh! He shoots Daniel in the face!

00:08:04.233 --> 00:08:05.833
It goes through though, so he's okay.

00:08:05.833 --> 00:08:08.900
So as Proctor John takes the dam, Victor's deal was for him and the Clarks safety.

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:10.666
But, for some reason, that deal's off.

00:08:10.666 --> 00:08:13.200
But Nick has the detonator to blow the whole thing up!

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.400
Yeah, new deal, my family goes free.

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:17.733
And now Nick decides “Screw it.”

00:08:17.733 --> 00:08:21.600
Yes he blows up the dam! Frees the river to the people.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.333
And so after a pretty great third season,

00:08:23.333 --> 00:08:25.600
Fear The Walking Dead is finally hitting its stride.

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:28.133
I'm excited for what new adventures await the Clark family

00:08:28.133 --> 00:08:30.333
in this interesting Mexicali region.

00:08:30.333 --> 00:08:32.766
But in season four, the show has a soft reboot,

00:08:32.766 --> 00:08:36.666
with a new main character: Morgan Jones! Crossing over from the main show.

00:08:36.666 --> 00:08:38.766
Rick Grimes met him in season one, he was a normal guy.

00:08:38.766 --> 00:08:40.400
But in season three, when his wife and son died,

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:42.166
he went crazy and started killing everyone.

00:08:42.166 --> 00:08:45.666
Later he made a friend who taught him “The Art of Peace” so now he doesn't kill anyone.

00:08:45.666 --> 00:08:47.266
But he had to kill during the Savior War,

00:08:47.266 --> 00:08:49.300
and he took it too far, started killing everyone.

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:51.100
So now Morgan's living by himself in the dump,

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:53.500
He's like, “Yo Rick, I got to leave the group and go find myself.”

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:56.066
And so he pulls of Forrest Gump, and just starts running...

00:08:56.066 --> 00:08:58.333
Runs himself all the way to Texas.

00:08:58.333 --> 00:09:00.100
His first right here is John Dorie,

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.766
a real life cowboy who was a professional trick shot artist.

00:09:02.766 --> 00:09:06.633
They befriend Al, who's got this big SWAT truck with epic guns built in!

00:09:06.633 --> 00:09:08.966
She was a reporter and is still going around filming people,

00:09:08.966 --> 00:09:11.000
getting the scoop on the zombie apocalypse.

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:13.900
They find someone who needs help, and it is Alicia Clark...

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:17.700
But oh it's a trap! Yes our old crew ambushes this new one.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:19.066
But very quickly they turn it around,

00:09:19.066 --> 00:09:21.566
and Al interviews them to find out how they ended up this way.

00:09:21.566 --> 00:09:23.700
After Mexico, the Clark family made it to Texas,

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.766
where they settled in an old baseball stadium.

00:09:25.766 --> 00:09:28.700
Things were great for a while, Luciana came back without explanation.

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:31.766
But one night a group arrived and menacingly just sat there.

00:09:31.766 --> 00:09:33.600
They're called the Vultures because they don't attack,

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:36.333
they just wait for settlements to fail, then scavenge the remains.

00:09:36.333 --> 00:09:39.133
And indeed the stadium is falling, because they got weevils in their crops.

00:09:39.133 --> 00:09:41.133
Our group manages to find some new seeds and replant,

00:09:41.133 --> 00:09:44.666
But then the Vultures bus in a bunch of zombies, and oh the stadium is overrun.

00:09:44.666 --> 00:09:46.233
Madison's kids are stuck outside the walls,

00:09:46.233 --> 00:09:49.966
and so she lights a flare and lures all the zombies inside,

00:09:49.966 --> 00:09:53.100
then locks the gate to the stadium and set it on fire!

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:55.900
Sacrificing herself to save her kids.

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.533
So in the present, Nick finds one of the Vultures,

00:09:57.533 --> 00:09:59.300
Morgan tries to stop him, “Hey, killing is bad.”

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:01.133
But Nick doesn't listen, kills this guy.

00:10:01.133 --> 00:10:03.633
But then immediately, Nick is shot!

00:10:03.633 --> 00:10:06.666
Oh! By Charlie! The little girl who was with the vultures,

00:10:06.666 --> 00:10:08.900
and the cycle of violence continues.

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:12.566
So Nick Clark, one of the best, most complex characters in The Walking Dead Universe, 

00:10:12.566 --> 00:10:14.666
gets a tear jerking death.

00:10:14.666 --> 00:10:16.233
So the group hunts down the rest of the Vultures,

00:10:16.233 --> 00:10:19.833
but one of them is this woman, June, who turns out was John Dorie's girlfriend.

00:10:19.833 --> 00:10:21.366
He was living a lonely life in his cabin,

00:10:21.366 --> 00:10:22.966
but one day he met June and they fell in love,

00:10:22.966 --> 00:10:24.733
but then she was scared and ran off.

00:10:24.733 --> 00:10:27.000
So Alicia wants to kill her, but Morgan is not going like that happen.

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:28.933
Gives her the speech, “Killing is bad.”

00:10:28.933 --> 00:10:30.866
And turns out Al had interviewed Madison,

00:10:30.866 --> 00:10:32.600
when they were separated earlier, I guess?

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:33.966
She talked about how she hoped her kids

00:10:33.966 --> 00:10:35.633
wouldn't lose themselves in the zombie apocalypse.

00:10:35.633 --> 00:10:38.366
And so it gets through to Alicia, and we're all friends now.

00:10:38.366 --> 00:10:41.066
Morgan's not planning to stick around, he's going to go back to Virginia.

00:10:41.066 --> 00:10:44.300
But on the way at a rest stop he meets a couple of truckers, Sarah and Wendell.

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:47.333
And they're still cruising the highways, helping people by dropping off supply boxes,

00:10:47.333 --> 00:10:48.733
“Take what you need. Leave what you don’t.”

00:10:48.733 --> 00:10:51.933
Turns out though they just stole this truck from the guy who was really doing it, Polar Bear.

00:10:51.933 --> 00:10:53.700
But Morgan convinces them to change their ways,

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:55.866
and now they're going around doing it for real.

00:10:55.866 --> 00:10:57.200
Pretty soon they recruit the rest of the group,

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:59.133
so Morgan &amp; Friends have a new mission,

00:10:59.133 --> 00:11:01.500
they are Texas trucker helper people.

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:04.366
Now Texas is a big place, so at this point the show becomes

00:11:04.366 --> 00:11:07.300
mostly just characters talking to each other over the walkie.

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:10.633
And the show becomes a huge snooze fest, as nothing really happens.

00:11:10.633 --> 00:11:14.266
Except when weird stuff happens, but honestly, I stopped paying attention.

00:11:14.266 --> 00:11:15.900
At one point there's a massive hurricane,

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:18.133
and Alicia take shelter with the Vulture girl, Charlie.

00:11:18.133 --> 00:11:19.900
But she's been infected with Morgan's “no killing,”

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:21.700
so she doesn't get revenge for her brother,

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:23.400
and instead, these two become best friends.

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:25.866
And if you're wondering what the heck Alicia is holding...

00:11:25.866 --> 00:11:28.700
At a water park she found a machine gun, but then the case came off,

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:32.366
she sharpened that into a point, and it's become her new signature zombie killing weapon.

00:11:32.366 --> 00:11:35.466
The main villain of this part of the show is this random dirty hobo lady

00:11:35.466 --> 00:11:37.700
who is mad, I guess, that our group is trying to help people. 

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:41.200
She starts sabotaging them, and our group can't just kill her because they don't kill people.

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:45.033
The big climax is when she poisons them, but earlier they met a brewer.

00:11:45.033 --> 00:11:47.500
He ended up dying, but Morgan brings in the Augie’s Ale beer truck,

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:50.400
and turns out, beer is the cure for poison.

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.500
June is a nurse, so it's medically sound.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:55.633
So the day is saved, and our group is free to keep driving around Texas,

00:11:55.633 --> 00:11:57.766
talking on walkies and helping people.

00:11:57.766 --> 00:12:01.000
So in season five, our group gets a call for help from the other side of Texas.

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:03.333
And apparently they can't drive there because the roads are out,

00:12:03.333 --> 00:12:06.600
So they fly a plane! Well, they crash a plane. 

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:08.933
But don't worry, they're fine, “We're here to help.”

00:12:08.933 --> 00:12:11.666
But turns out it was a fake call from this other trucker, Logan,

00:12:11.666 --> 00:12:14.000
who was Polar Bear’s old partner and used to live here,

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.166
and came up with an excuse to get them all out.

00:12:16.166 --> 00:12:18.133
So half our group is stranded on the other side of Texas,

00:12:18.133 --> 00:12:21.433
And there's someone here who's marking their territory by stringing zombies together!

00:12:21.433 --> 00:12:23.266
Turns out it is a feral group of kids,

00:12:23.266 --> 00:12:26.733
but Morgan gives them a talking to, and our group adopts a bunch of children.

00:12:26.733 --> 00:12:27.966
While they're working to fix their plane,

00:12:27.966 --> 00:12:31.066
John and June go to the old western town where he worked as a gunslinger.

00:12:31.066 --> 00:12:34.433
And here they meet Dwight! Crossing over from The Walking Dead.

00:12:34.433 --> 00:12:37.800
Remember he was one of Negan's top guys, but he switched sides to help our group.

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:39.933
He's looking for his wife, Sherry, who ran away from Negan,

00:12:39.933 --> 00:12:42.233
but left him the clue, the beer and pretzels, “Forever Honeymoon.”

00:12:42.233 --> 00:12:44.233
And he's followed her trail all the way to Texas.

00:12:44.233 --> 00:12:45.966
But now he's trapped and there's two zombies left,

00:12:45.966 --> 00:12:47.866
and John Dorie has only got one bullet.

00:12:47.866 --> 00:12:50.366
So he has Dwight hold up the axe for the trick shot...

00:12:50.366 --> 00:12:53.633
The San Antonio Split! Woah! Splits the bullet.

00:12:53.633 --> 00:12:56.066
Then rejoining the show is Daniel Salazar,

00:12:56.066 --> 00:12:58.100
who is pretty mad at Strand for shooting him in the face.

00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:01.866
But he forgives him, he's a nice old man now who's adopted a cat, Skid Mark.

00:13:01.866 --> 00:13:05.166
Strand wants to borrow his plane to rescue their friends, but the plane breaks.

00:13:05.166 --> 00:13:07.266
But Strand finds another flying vehicle,

00:13:07.266 --> 00:13:10.233
yes, the Augie's Ale hot air balloon!

00:13:10.233 --> 00:13:12.066
This show has gone off the rails.

00:13:12.066 --> 00:13:14.666
But something important happens for the wider Walking Dead Universe,

00:13:14.666 --> 00:13:18.200
as Althea finds a soldier from the Civic Republic Military!

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:20.666
Yes the mysterious super group with the three ring logo

00:13:20.666 --> 00:13:23.733
that has the helicopters that took Rick Grimes!

00:13:23.733 --> 00:13:25.233
Al is captured by one of their soldiers,

00:13:25.233 --> 00:13:27.366
and they're real serious, supposed to shoot people on sight.

00:13:27.366 --> 00:13:28.566
But her helicopter is out of fuel,

00:13:28.566 --> 00:13:30.500
so she needs Al’s help to climb the mountain and get more.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:32.433
And now they've bonded so she breaks protocol,

00:13:32.433 --> 00:13:34.666
instead of killing her, they start making out!

00:13:34.666 --> 00:13:37.000
But the big problem on the side of Texas is radiation.

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:40.766
As the scientist Grace explains, the nuclear power plant is melting down.

00:13:40.766 --> 00:13:44.633
So they fix the plane just on time to escape the nuclear apocalypse!
 ...For now.

00:13:44.633 --> 00:13:48.300
So back on the good side of Texas, we've got a found footage thing going on,

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:51.766
as our group is filming a documentary on how they're helping people,

00:13:51.766 --> 00:13:54.566
and leaving it in VCRs at rest stops, I guess.

00:13:54.566 --> 00:13:56.400
They make some new friends like this random Rabbi,

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.233
and this guy Wes who has been painting trees,

00:13:58.233 --> 00:14:00.366
and inspires Alicia to paint trees too.

00:14:00.366 --> 00:14:02.066
But driving around Texas takes a lot of gas,

00:14:02.066 --> 00:14:04.266
and it seems like our crew has an infinite supply.

00:14:04.266 --> 00:14:07.100
Turns out they found an oil refinery called Tank Town,

00:14:07.100 --> 00:14:10.200
and they're using zombie power to drill for oil, cool.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:13.433
But remember Logan, he's still around, and now his crew comes to take it.

00:14:13.433 --> 00:14:15.800
But what's this? They're all killed by a bigger group,

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:19.400
who ride around on horses, led by the red-haired Virginia.

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:22.300
She and her Rangers are consolidating Texas under her rule,

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:24.000
and our group is all invited to join.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.933
Problem is she doesn't help everyone,

00:14:25.933 --> 00:14:27.866
she only accepts people who add value to the group.

00:14:27.866 --> 00:14:29.966
So Morgan rejects her, “We're going to keep doing things our way.”

00:14:29.966 --> 00:14:32.133
And so she makes her own documentary,

00:14:32.133 --> 00:14:34.733
and for a while we got warring documentaries.

00:14:34.733 --> 00:14:36.700
This one dude in Morgan's group is so dedicated,

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:38.700
he keeps filming when the bridge collapses,

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:40.933
and has the dumbest death in The Walking Dead.

00:14:40.933 --> 00:14:44.000
Virginia did take Tank Town though, and so with our group out of gas,

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:47.300
they're walking to another community, but it's all overrun with zombies.

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.533
So they have to give up, “Alright Virginia, we’ll join you.”

00:14:49.533 --> 00:14:51.766
But then they realize they can just lure the zombies out of there,

00:14:51.766 --> 00:14:54.766
and they fix up this town, and John and June get married.

00:14:54.766 --> 00:14:57.300
But Virginia was already on her way, so she crashes the wedding,

00:14:57.300 --> 00:14:59.400
and now joining her is not optional.

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:01.333
Just to be mean, she separates our whole group,

00:15:01.333 --> 00:15:03.166
sending them off to her different communities.

00:15:03.166 --> 00:15:04.966
But Morgan Jones is staying here,

00:15:04.966 --> 00:15:06.966
he's a leader that could undermine her rule,

00:15:06.966 --> 00:15:08.433
so she has got to kill him!

00:15:08.433 --> 00:15:12.400
But before she can finish him off, she gets a call that Grace is pregnant!

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:15.100
Yes, all season she thought she was dying of radiation poisoning,

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.566
but turns out pregnancy has the same symptoms?

00:15:17.566 --> 00:15:19.700
And Morgan and Grace have fallen in love,

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:21.733
but actually, the baby is not his,

00:15:21.733 --> 00:15:24.333
it was from the other guy she was dating... before?

00:15:24.333 --> 00:15:26.200
Anyway, now that he's going to be - kind of - a father,

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:28.966
Virginia doesn't kill him and leaves him there to bleed out.

00:15:28.966 --> 00:15:31.166
But in season six, Morgan does not bleed out.

00:15:31.166 --> 00:15:34.000
He meets a new friend who has a safe place to live behind a dam,

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:36.700
yeah the lake is dried up, so there's a whole hidden valley here.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:39.566
But now a cool axe wielding bounty hunter is after Morgan,

00:15:39.566 --> 00:15:41.400
Virginia sent him to finish the job.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:42.533
And he's not scared of Morgan,

00:15:42.533 --> 00:15:45.666
because he watched the documentary about how he doesn't kill people.

00:15:45.666 --> 00:15:48.600
And so to stop this guy, Morgan has to kill again!

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:50.633
He attaches this guy's axe to his staff,

00:15:50.633 --> 00:15:53.466
to represent that  now he can kill, when he has to.

00:15:53.466 --> 00:15:55.433
So Morgan resolves to build a new community here,

00:15:55.433 --> 00:15:58.000
and rescue all his friends from the villainous Virginia.

00:15:58.000 --> 00:15:59.733
Of course, Virginia is not a bad villain,

00:15:59.733 --> 00:16:01.766
in most of her settlements, life is pretty good.

00:16:01.766 --> 00:16:04.100
But undesirables are put on zombie killing duty,

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.000
And when they're overrun, to save himself,

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:08.233
Strand injures this guy and throws him to the horde!

00:16:08.233 --> 00:16:10.033
and for his ingenuity, Strand is promoted,

00:16:10.033 --> 00:16:11.800
Virginia makes him one of her Rangers.

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:13.400
Al and Dwight are sent out scouting,

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:17.800
and who does Dwight finally find, but his long lost wife Sherry!

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:20.233
Oh! Forever Honeymoon reunited.

00:16:20.233 --> 00:16:24.133
But she's made friends with the Virginia resistance group of people 
that she cast out, 

00:16:24.133 --> 00:16:27.200
So Dwight joins them and they do a big heist to get the SWAT truck back.

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:28.966
Now we meet Virginia's little sister Dakota,

00:16:28.966 --> 00:16:31.933
who wants to join our group because she thinks her sister is evil.

00:16:31.933 --> 00:16:34.033
But John Dorie was investigating a murder cover up,

00:16:34.033 --> 00:16:37.166
and turns out Dakota was the killer! She's a messed up little kid.

00:16:37.166 --> 00:16:40.333
And now, in fact, she shoots John Dorie! What?!

00:16:40.333 --> 00:16:45.033
His nurse wife June is here to help, but oh! She’s too late! John Dorie dies.

00:16:45.033 --> 00:16:46.300
But now Virginia wants her sister back,

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:48.666
so she's going to execute our group if Morgan doesn't return her.

00:16:48.666 --> 00:16:50.933
She wants Strand to pull the trigger to prove his loyalty,

00:16:50.933 --> 00:16:54.966
But Victor Strand has used his smooth talking skills to get half the Rangers on his side,

00:16:54.966 --> 00:16:58.433
Oh! It's a coup against Virginia, blam blam blam!

00:16:58.433 --> 00:17:01.800
So Morgan offers Virginia asylum, everyone else wants her executed.

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:03.500
But Morgan doesn't kill her!

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:05.900
He dramatically thrusts his axe into the ground,

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:08.066
“No more killing any more. Again.”

00:17:08.066 --> 00:17:11.366
But June blames Virginia for John Dorie's death and she kills her!

00:17:11.366 --> 00:17:13.466
Oh! And now June's banished from the group.

00:17:13.466 --> 00:17:15.566
But the rest of our group is all together again,

00:17:15.566 --> 00:17:17.333
living happily in Morgan's Hidden Valley.

00:17:17.333 --> 00:17:21.400
And if they start raising horses, they can call it Morgan's Hidden Valley Ranch.

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:23.500
But a new bad group starts sabotaging them,

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:25.800
and they like to graffiti “The End is the Beginning.”

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:27.866
They’re a doomsday cult living in a bunker,

00:17:27.866 --> 00:17:30.400
and their leader is the charismatic weirdo, Teddy.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.300
Meanwhile June found a random old man,

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:35.866
who turns out is none other than John Dorie, Senior!

00:17:35.866 --> 00:17:39.966
And Teddy is the serial killer that he was hunting when he was a cop.

00:17:39.966 --> 00:17:42.166
Wow. Texas is a really small world.

00:17:42.166 --> 00:17:45.066
And they found a beached nuclear submarine,

00:17:45.066 --> 00:17:47.533
so Teddy's plan is to nuke all of Texas,

00:17:47.533 --> 00:17:49.666
and end the world... even more.

00:17:49.666 --> 00:17:52.533
So Morgan and Strand bust in to stop them, but they’re overrun.

00:17:52.533 --> 00:17:55.533
Strand’s like “Hey Morgan, you're willing to sacrifice yourself to save the world, right?”

00:17:55.533 --> 00:17:56.766
“Because... I'm not.”

00:17:56.766 --> 00:17:59.900
And he pushes Morgan into the zombies to save himself!

00:17:59.900 --> 00:18:03.100
But, Morgan survives, so now things between them are awkward.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.933
But they're still too late, Teddy launches the Missiles!

00:18:05.933 --> 00:18:07.400
Dakota, by the way, had joined Teddy,

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:10.133
but long story short now she realizes he's a fraud so she kills him.

00:18:10.133 --> 00:18:12.800
But the nukes already launched so yes, it's happening... 

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:16.200
BOOM!!! Nuclear Apocalypse Texas Time.

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:18.566
Ma0gically our group all somehow found bunkers,

00:18:18.566 --> 00:18:20.866
Alicia in fact was put in Teddy's main one.

00:18:20.866 --> 00:18:23.966
In fact most of our gang was picked up by a helicopter!

00:18:23.966 --> 00:18:27.366
Yeah Al called her Civic Republic girlfriend to give them a lift.

00:18:27.366 --> 00:18:28.966
They don't fly to the Civic Republic though,

00:18:28.966 --> 00:18:30.700
she just drops them outside the blast radius.

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:32.500
And pretty soon after, Al leaves the group

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:34.900
to live happily ever after with her helicopter girlfriend.

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:36.833
Morgan and Grace did not find a bunker,

00:18:36.833 --> 00:18:39.100
uh, they just hid under a truck, which I guess works.

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:40.866
And by the way, yeah, they've got a baby.

00:18:40.866 --> 00:18:42.866
But it's not Grace's baby, hers didn't make it.

00:18:42.866 --> 00:18:46.766
It's another random baby who they named “Morgan,” and named Morgan the godfather.

00:18:46.766 --> 00:18:49.100
Victor Strand didn't find a bunker, he found an apartment,

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:50.600
so he figured this was the end.

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:53.500
But this building turns out to be just outside the blast radius,

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:56.633
and Victor Strand now believes he's on the right path.

00:18:56.633 --> 00:19:00.200
So in season seven, it's the nuclear apocalypse in the zombie apocalypse.

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:04.033
And everyone's adjusted really quick, managed to make radiation suits and stuff.

00:19:04.033 --> 00:19:06.166
But they can't leave Texas because of where the bombs dropped,

00:19:06.166 --> 00:19:07.933
it's penning them in, they're all stuck here.

00:19:07.933 --> 00:19:10.900
But right in the middle is the safe zone of Victor Strand's Tower.

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:14.066
Strand is adopted, a new style, now dressing in Dictator Chic.

00:19:14.066 --> 00:19:17.233
And he's become a dictator, making the hard choices to keep this place safe,

00:19:17.233 --> 00:19:19.200
executing anyone who doesn't support him.

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:20.900
But he only lets in those with useful skills,

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:23.166
even half hour old group, he sends them packing.

00:19:23.166 --> 00:19:24.866
And Morgan especially he doesn't want in,

00:19:24.866 --> 00:19:26.700
after their awkwardness on the sub last season.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:29.566
But he does accept Baby Mo, and sort of keeps her as a hostage.

00:19:29.566 --> 00:19:31.000
Alicia was in Teddy's bunker,

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:32.966
but with Teddy dead, she kind of takes over.

00:19:32.966 --> 00:19:36.166
Now this was a real government bunker where a Senator was hiding before he died.

00:19:36.166 --> 00:19:37.733
She befriends his aide, who's still alive,

00:19:37.733 --> 00:19:40.733
and he has files about a safe place, “Padre,” more on that later.

00:19:40.733 --> 00:19:42.666
But now tragically Alicia is bit!

00:19:42.666 --> 00:19:45.800
She amputates her arm, but she was too late, she’s still got the zombie fever.

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:48.066
It seems to be slowed down, though, she's okay for a while.

00:19:48.066 --> 00:19:51.133
So she straps her arm bone back on to herself!

00:19:51.133 --> 00:19:53.133
And makes it her new signature weapon.

00:19:53.133 --> 00:19:54.866
Now Strand likes Alicia, he's going to let her in,

00:19:54.866 --> 00:19:57.500
but when she finds out he killed her senator's aide boyfriend,

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:00.033
she's like, “You’ve become the villain, Victor. This means war!”

00:20:00.033 --> 00:20:02.233
But they can't attack the tower with baby Mo inside,

00:20:02.233 --> 00:20:04.566
so it's John Dorie Senior who suits up in armor

00:20:04.566 --> 00:20:06.666
to get her out of there and sacrifices himself.

00:20:06.666 --> 00:20:09.033
So Alicia leads the group in an assault on the tower!

00:20:09.033 --> 00:20:11.866
Wes had joined Team Strand, but now he betrays him to take over

00:20:11.866 --> 00:20:13.933
so Strand kills Wes to save Alicia.

00:20:13.933 --> 00:20:17.533
Then in Alicia and Strand's final fight, they burn the tower down so no one gets it.

00:20:17.533 --> 00:20:21.400
And so with nowhere safe left in Texas, the rest of our group takes to the sea.

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:24.466
Alicia hallucinates a bird, which makes her realize she forgives Strand,

00:20:24.466 --> 00:20:27.600
and sends him off to join them, while she stays behind to die of zombie fever.

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:29.800
Except she doesn't though, I guess she’s fine.

00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:31.566
Now Morgan made it to Louisiana,

00:20:31.566 --> 00:20:34.800
and who does he meet here but Madison Clark!!!

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:37.533
After all this time, they brought her back.

00:20:37.533 --> 00:20:39.700
She survived the stadium fire but inhaled a lot of smoke,

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:41.266
so now she needs an oxygen tank.

00:20:41.266 --> 00:20:44.500
And she's picked up a new signature weapon, a gigantic sledgehammer.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:46.233
But now she kidnaps little Mo,

00:20:46.233 --> 00:20:49.700
yeah, she's working as a baby snatcher for a group called Padre.

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:51.566
But when Morgan tells her he was friends with her kids,

00:20:51.566 --> 00:20:53.533
“Although I'm sorry to say, they're both dead now.”

00:20:53.533 --> 00:20:56.433
But now she's willing to turn on Padre and help him get his daughter back.

00:20:56.433 --> 00:20:58.533
So in season eight, Padre is on a hidden island

00:20:58.533 --> 00:21:00.633
that was originally a military safe zone.

00:21:00.633 --> 00:21:03.433
And they are successfully keeping kids safe, but they're kind of brainwashing them,

00:21:03.433 --> 00:21:05.433
“You don't need your parents, you just need Padre.”

00:21:05.433 --> 00:21:07.633
Now, Padre himself hides behind two-way glass,

00:21:07.633 --> 00:21:09.100
and only communicates over the speaker.

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:10.833
Morgan and Madison tried to rescue Mo,

00:21:10.833 --> 00:21:12.933
but it seems like they failed, Madison is captured.

00:21:12.933 --> 00:21:14.900
This one girl finds Madison and helps her escape,

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:18.166
but soon Madison realizes this is baby Mo!

00:21:18.166 --> 00:21:22.300
It's been a seven year time jump to catch up with The Walking Dead Prime.

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:24.000
So Madison helps Mo escape, again,

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:26.933
But when they find Morgan, he's working for Padre!

00:21:26.933 --> 00:21:29.933
Yeah he and Grace decided that Padre could keep Mo safer than they could,

00:21:29.933 --> 00:21:32.500
and so have let her grow up without them in her life.

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:35.300
But this woman, Shrike, is the Padre leader who is not behind the glass,

00:21:35.300 --> 00:21:37.200
And she can't risk Mo meeting her parents again,

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:39.100
so she tries to kill Morgan! He's got to escape.

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:40.933
Dwight and Sherry have been working for Padre too,

00:21:40.933 --> 00:21:43.000
they took the same deal because they have a son now.

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:45.333
But now they bring him to June because he needs medical attention.

00:21:45.333 --> 00:21:47.466
But June had left Padre because they were making her do experiments,

00:21:47.466 --> 00:21:50.133
having people bit on purpose and blasting them with radiation.

00:21:50.133 --> 00:21:51.766
Inspired by how Alicia survived so long,

00:21:51.766 --> 00:21:54.033
 they think radiation might be the key to the zombie cure.

00:21:54.033 --> 00:21:55.400
And now Shrek captures them all,

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:58.633
and with the zombie head mounted on the crane arm, has their son bit!

00:21:58.633 --> 00:22:01.300
So June will have to resume the experiments in hopes to save his life.

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:04.633
But now Shrike is captured by the Padre resistance of disgruntled parents,

00:22:04.633 --> 00:22:08.966
who have been formed into a guerrilla commando crew by Captain Daniel Salazar.

00:22:08.966 --> 00:22:12.800
By the way, his main plot in season six and seven was that he's old now, he’s got dementia.

00:22:12.800 --> 00:22:15.900
But he's been drinking Ginkgo tea, and so he's cured now.

00:22:15.900 --> 00:22:19.133
So they break the glass to meet the real Padre, who turns out is Shrike’s brother.

00:22:19.133 --> 00:22:21.066
Their father was the original Padre commander,

00:22:21.066 --> 00:22:23.166
but when he died in front of them, they were real sad.

00:22:23.166 --> 00:22:25.200
And they decided that kids are better without their parents,

00:22:25.200 --> 00:22:27.233
so they don't have to be sad when their parents die.

00:22:27.233 --> 00:22:29.266
Meanwhile, Morgan and family have gotten away,

00:22:29.266 --> 00:22:31.000
They've gone all the way to Atlanta,

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:34.500
to his house from season one, where he met Rick Grimes!

00:22:34.500 --> 00:22:37.133
He wanted to face his demons and lay to rest his wife and son,

00:22:37.133 --> 00:22:39.700
so that he and his new family can live happily ever after.

00:22:39.700 --> 00:22:43.233
But just then, oh no, it's a zombie attack! And Grace is bit!

00:22:43.233 --> 00:22:46.600
So they boat all the way back to Padre, in the hopes
 the radiation cure can heal her,

00:22:46.600 --> 00:22:48.433
because it seemed to work on Dwight and Sherry’s son. 

00:22:48.433 --> 00:22:51.233
But it doesn’t last it just slowed it down a little, and he does die.

00:22:51.233 --> 00:22:53.600
So Grace has her tearful farewell with Morgan,

00:22:53.600 --> 00:22:56.000
in the style of this show, over the walkie.

00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:58.666
But now Morgan starts writing “Clear” on the walls again.

00:22:58.666 --> 00:23:01.133
Yeah, he goes crazy like Walking Dead season three

00:23:01.133 --> 00:23:03.366
when he's blacking out and trying to kill everyone.

00:23:03.366 --> 00:23:04.800
But soon he gets himself under control,

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:07.233
and in the final showdown with Padre he gives the big speech

00:23:07.233 --> 00:23:09.300
and the power of love wins the day.

00:23:09.300 --> 00:23:12.033
Except for Shrike, who was awful, and June kills her.

00:23:12.033 --> 00:23:15.200
Now It's time for Morgan to say goodbye, he’s going back this time

00:23:15.200 --> 00:23:18.533
to actually meet up with his original Walking Dead friends!

00:23:18.533 --> 00:23:20.400
He tries to call his old friend Rick Grimes,

00:23:20.400 --> 00:23:22.600
“Hey man, if you're out there, I'm coming to find you.”

00:23:22.600 --> 00:23:26.833
And so Morgan Jones, with his daughter Morgan, set off on another adventure.

00:23:26.833 --> 00:23:30.433
Madison Clark is staying behind, going to turn Padre into a good place.

00:23:30.433 --> 00:23:32.800
But now we catch up with Victor Strand!

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:37.466
Who is inexplicably speaking German with a new hot boyfriend and adopted son.

00:23:37.466 --> 00:23:41.800
But now Madison Clark has tracked him down, yes old best friends reunited!

00:23:41.800 --> 00:23:43.866
But a new bad group has followed her here...

00:23:43.866 --> 00:23:47.033
Led by none other than Troy Otto!!!

00:23:47.033 --> 00:23:49.666
Yeah they're bringing everyone back!

00:23:49.666 --> 00:23:52.066
Yeah he survived Madison's hammer to the head,

00:23:52.066 --> 00:23:55.133
and now he's here for revenge and to take over Padre.

00:23:55.133 --> 00:24:00.300
And his revenge on Madison has already begun because he killed Alicia!

00:24:00.300 --> 00:24:02.066
To take down Troy they need some more allies,

00:24:02.066 --> 00:24:06.033
so they find Luciana who's still trucking around, taken up Polar Bear’s old mantle.

00:24:06.033 --> 00:24:08.800
Working with her is Charlie, who survived the radiation,

00:24:08.800 --> 00:24:11.733
and Madison finally learns she's the one who killed Nick.

00:24:11.733 --> 00:24:14.400
But Troy takes her hostage, going to trade her for Padre’s location.

00:24:14.400 --> 00:24:19.200
But Charlie breaks free, and to make up for Nick, and save Padre, she no! Kills herself.

00:24:19.200 --> 00:24:20.833
But then our crew takes a kid prisoner,

00:24:20.833 --> 00:24:23.400
it's this girl, Tracy, who is Troy's daughter.

00:24:23.400 --> 00:24:25.433
And she's like, “Madison, you killed my mom!”

00:24:25.433 --> 00:24:27.200
“Wait, what? I didn't know your mom.”

00:24:27.200 --> 00:24:29.433
Turns out Alicia rescued them, and inspired Troy's wife

00:24:29.433 --> 00:24:31.300
to try to help people, which got her killed.

00:24:31.300 --> 00:24:35.700
And because Madison was the one who told Alicia to help people, Troy blames Madison.

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:38.100
But now Madison and Troy are captured by the Padre brother,

00:24:38.100 --> 00:24:40.400
they got to work together to escape across this bridge,

00:24:40.400 --> 00:24:42.633
which obviously is not a good escape plan.

00:24:42.633 --> 00:24:43.833
But now they've had a heart to heart,

00:24:43.833 --> 00:24:45.566
Troy's like, “I'm sorry, Let's be friends.”

00:24:45.566 --> 00:24:48.200
But Madison, oh! Doesn’t forgive him!

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.166
She kills him! ...Again.

00:24:50.166 --> 00:24:53.433
But now Troy drops a new truth bomb, Tracy isn’t his daughter...

00:24:53.433 --> 00:24:56.100
it’s Alicia’s daughter! Who he kidnaped.

00:24:56.100 --> 00:24:58.066
So now Madison wants to protect her granddaughter,

00:24:58.066 --> 00:25:01.100
but it's like, “Yo, you just killed my dad,” and she shoots her!

00:25:01.100 --> 00:25:03.033
And now, to avenge Troy, his gang

00:25:03.033 --> 00:25:06.133
wrangled up a Zombie horde, and unleashed it at Padre!

00:25:06.133 --> 00:25:08.400
So things look bleak, our crew is surrounded, but...

00:25:08.400 --> 00:25:12.733
Madison Clark survived! The bullet hit Alicia's lucky necklace.

00:25:12.733 --> 00:25:15.500
So Madison Clark runs over there and does what she does best,

00:25:15.500 --> 00:25:19.166
leads all the zombies inside so all the people can escape,

00:25:19.166 --> 00:25:21.366
and lights the whole place on fire!

00:25:21.366 --> 00:25:23.433
Everyone assumes she's dead for real this time,

00:25:23.433 --> 00:25:26.333
except she's not, Tracey pulled her out of the rubble.

00:25:26.333 --> 00:25:30.100
And now coming to join them is Alicia! Who is also alive!

00:25:30.100 --> 00:25:32.166
Troy stabbed her, but she recovered.

00:25:32.166 --> 00:25:34.666
And now mother and daughter are reunited.

00:25:34.666 --> 00:25:36.333
Madison's excited to be a grandma,

00:25:36.333 --> 00:25:38.366
but Alicia's like, “I don't have a kid.”

00:25:38.366 --> 00:25:40.300
Troy knows Madison protects her own family,

00:25:40.300 --> 00:25:42.733
so he lied about that so she would protect her.

00:25:42.733 --> 00:25:46.266
So now they go to check on their friends, who are back to their old ways,
trucking around.

00:25:46.266 --> 00:25:48.200
But now, in honor of Madison’s sacrifice,

00:25:48.200 --> 00:25:50.666
they've renamed Padre to Madre.

00:25:50.666 --> 00:25:53.966
But Padre is a smoking ruin, so our crew has no home base.

00:25:53.966 --> 00:25:58.200
Dwight has an idea to go back to the Sanctuary, yeah, Negan's old fortress!

00:25:58.200 --> 00:26:00.033
He randomly went back there earlier this season

00:26:00.033 --> 00:26:02.133
and took out the new gang that was living inside.

00:26:02.133 --> 00:26:04.400
He's like, “We should take it and make it a good place.”

00:26:04.400 --> 00:26:06.400
So he and Sherry are going to try that.

00:26:06.400 --> 00:26:08.000
The rest of the group is splitting up for now,

00:26:08.000 --> 00:26:10.066
just hanging with their closest loved ones.

00:26:10.066 --> 00:26:12.266
But as Strand is heading off with his new German family,

00:26:12.266 --> 00:26:14.766
he sees the Clark Girls in the rearview mirror.

00:26:14.766 --> 00:26:17.800
And it's a tearful farewell as he realizes what they're doing...

00:26:17.800 --> 00:26:21.300
Their deaths have inspired the group more than their lives would.

00:26:21.300 --> 00:26:25.366
And they decide they're going to go to check out their old home of Los Angeles.

00:26:25.366 --> 00:26:28.500
And that's where Fear the Walking Dead comes to an end.

00:26:29.566 --> 00:26:31.800
If you liked this recap, hit that subscribe button,

00:26:31.800 --> 00:26:34.900
for more of the best recaps of TV and movies.

